{"ref":"BDB, עֲנָה","hw":"עֲנָה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָה</span></big><sub>12</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Horites:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:2\" href=\"/Genesis.36.2\">Gn 36:2</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹרִי</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחִוִּי</span> v. Di) v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:14\" href=\"/Genesis.36.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:18\" href=\"/Genesis.36.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:20\" href=\"/Genesis.36.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:25\" href=\"/Genesis.36.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:29\" href=\"/Genesis.36.29\">29</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.38\">1 Ch 1:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.41\">41</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  (‘nephew’ of <strong>1</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:24\" href=\"/Genesis.36.24\">Gn 36:24</a><sup>(×2)</sup> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.40\">1 Ch 1:40</a>.—Ανα, Α(ι)να(ν) <strong>(</strong>cf. n.pr.m. <span dir=\"rtl\">ען</span>, Safa, Hal<sup>JAs 7, x. 374</sup><strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, ענו","prev":"BDB, עָנָה⁴"}